{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の追随を許さない学園最強の剣士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦国時代から続く武家・朱雀院家の4姉妹の末娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"刀輝とは昔なじみで良き理解者でもあり、基本的にベタ甘。 姉を公言し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内心あわよくば彼をヒモにして飼いたい、甘やかしたいという思考の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰に対しても笑顔を絶やさず優しい人柄だが、怒る時も笑顔で腹の底が読めない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「刀輝くん？　お姉ちゃん、性欲をコントロールできない男の子はダメだと思うなー？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56209"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1543c89ed532a6726d34ab9da059e2b7e88ee5876c9a81449af7ac7c99c9ddf6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3df700772db495fa698e9d1c596953f949cc61f15387617f1abcac67de2ba86.webp","width":124,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大橋歩夕","creatorId":"vndb:s1178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1178","name":"大橋 歩夕","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:307267:56209:6174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63831","characterName":"三城 刀輝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63831"},"originalCharacterName":"三城 刀輝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"Touki has the qualities of a Saniwa, a person who judges which god or spirit has taken possession of a miko (Shinto). Because this quality, he can be a vessel for any spirit like Magatsumi, Ayase, or rakshasa (a type of evil spirit). But Rakshasa are a special spirit exclusive for Kamiizumi Family, and since Touki has a blood relative with the Kamiizumi Family, he can awaken Rakshasa's blood. This Rakshasa's blood is the cause for his trauma against forging katana, and feelings of guilt towards murdering his childhood friend. He also possesses the qualities of a warrior (戦人), tailoring to a high combat effectiveness."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63831"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70ad97eaeffd22d278f3b62eac641892b7007d81d94772dbdb164f57cfbe1655.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/786276b57859ae245109df229c9f3d824eda9af6d24ee81ad9c15edf9abb4441.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p7001","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5487","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7001","name":"CRYSTALiA","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:29608:5487","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7001","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7001","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7001","name":"CRYSTALiA","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:80772:v28537","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7001","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7001","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7001","name":"CRYSTALiA","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:82372:v28537","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7866","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7866","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7866","name":"天之圣杯汉化组","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:86413:v28537","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":[],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
